  "kernel": "aae0c99c694f2aafdaaf6912f0936e4a39e092dd",
  "kernel_repo": "Aiden-HQ/AidenHQ",
  "notes": [
    "May add authority (grants, writes, roles or secrets) in: codehost-local, github, open-loops, owner-channel, platform, security. Auto-updates accept it; turn them off to review first.",
    "Sign in by default, your own app only for more",
    "Per-PR timeline, analytics tabs and complete flow data",
    "Stage timings, idle reasons, DORA and churn from one fact log",
    "Google's reconnect advice points to a Desktop client, not an SSH tunnel",
    "Apply removes a dropped service's stopped container too",
    "Every connected sign-in offers Reconnect on its tile",
    "A wake a later job absorbed isn't pending, so its idle task shows as orphaned",
    "Read a code host's write kinds as their bare action (#787)",
    "A job's card names the task it is working",
    "Node 24.22.3 for its high CVEs",
    "A stale PR outside the agents org is the owner's, never a close task",
    "A check waits for a free computer instead of failing when every one is busy",
    "An Engineer finishes its task once its PR merges",
    "A reviewer eval still holds when main moves without changing what judges it",
    "The security agents may hand a fix task to the Fleet Steward",
    "Verify-security skips a connection whose service isn't compiled",
    "The Steward's open-PR list includes the fleet's PRs outside the agents org",
    "An agent's PR that turns green wakes its task to merge it",
    "A check re-run during a restart never shares the old run's folder, and a broken eval is an error, not a fail"
  ],
  "release": "2026.11.19.8"
}
